改金额恢复原件摘要只证明内容是否相同，不证明余额真实或已上链。\n      分项验收与未覆盖内容失败区块的金额不与目标区块金额直接比较。没有远程部署证明时始终标记“未验证”。\n     \n     \n      预览公开字段实际产品将公开地址、查询范围、区块、规则观测与局限。私有提示、用户身份和访问令牌不进入公开报告。生成公开预览本地公开预览SAMPLE确认此样例的公开字段与摘要加入本地示例登记队列不会签名、广播或产生交易 hash。\n      查看规范化报告对象本地摘要实现用于设计演示。生产版本需经验证的库、完整测试向量与真实数据。\n     \n    \n   "}, {"tag": "span", "attrs": {"id": "integrity-status", "class": "pill"}, "value": "", "text": "尚未核对"}, {"tag": "span", "attrs": {"id": "report-result", "class": "pill"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "dl", "attrs": {"id": "evidence-scope", "class": "scope-grid"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"id": "original-hash", "class": "hash-box mono"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "button", "attrs": {"id": "verify-hash", "class": "primary"}, "value": "", "text": "核对内容摘要"}, {"tag": "button", "attrs": {"id": "tamper-report"}, "value": "", "text": "模拟篡改金额"}, {"tag": "button", "attrs": {"id": "restore-report"}, "value": "", "text": "恢复原件"}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"id": "hash-message", "class": "callout", "style": "margin-top:12px", "aria-live": "polite"}, "value": "", "text": "摘要只证明内容是否相同，不证明余额真实或已上链。"}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"id": "evidence-checks"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "button", "attrs": {"id": "preview-public"}, "value": "", "text": "生成公开预览"}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"id": "public-preview", "class": "preview", "hidden": ""}, "value": "", "text": "本地公开预览SAMPLE确认此样例的公开字段与摘要加入本地示例登记队列"}, {"tag": "p", "attrs": {"id": "disclosure", "class": "small"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"id": "preview-hash", "class": "mono"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "input", "attrs": {"id": "ack-public", "type": "checkbox"}, "value": "", "text": ""}, {"tag": "button", "attrs": {"id": "publish-local", "class": "primary", "style": "margin-top:12px", "disabled": "disabled"}, "value": "", "text": "加入本地示例登记队列"}, {"tag": "p", "attrs": {"id": "publication-note", "class": "small muted", "aria-live": "polite"}, "value": "", "text": "不会签名、广播或产生交易 